  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIAtr">VII Atr</ref> 2.5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et sciat omnis presbiter et tungravius et decimales homines, ut haec elemosina et ieiunium proveniat, sicut in sanctis iurare poterunt.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And every priest and the reeve of every village and the heads of the tithings shall be witnesses that this alms-giving and fasting is carried out, and shall be able to swear to it on the holy relics.</ab>
      </div>
